{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-skyscape-altius","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"skyscape-altius-sobha-realty-sobha-hartland-2","about":"Skyscape Altius is a contemporary project by developer Sobha Realty located in the Sobha Hartland 2 community. The 85-story tower features elegant 1-3 bedroom apartments with unparalleled views of the clear waters of the lagoon and the mesmerizing panorama of the city.Skyscape Altius epitomizes urban luxury with its elegant design and premium finishes, setting new standards of sophistication.Residents have access to a variety of amenities, including a swimming pool, gym, children's play areas, sports courts, and a picturesque park with plenty of green spaces, walking and jogging paths, and barbecue areas. There are cafes, restaurants and stores within walking distance.With its convenient location, Skyscape Altius provides residents with quick access to Dubai's attractions. Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary is in close proximity, while Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall and Meydan Racecourse are all within a 5-minute radius. Dubai Opera can be reached in 10 minutes, while Dubai International Airport, DIFC, Dubai Marina and Palm Jumeirah are about 20 minutes away.Skyscape Altius is an ideal choice for those looking for a comfortable and cozy lifestyle.","price":null,"title":"Skyscape Altius","bitrix":{"id":872,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Skyscape Altius","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Skyscape Altius","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Sobha Realty","project_location":"Sobha Hartland 2"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2444/images/2024/07/08/340x252/NPkb6lfmqlaPcwdojd9FPkVUGBtQAM9gsYJ039df.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2444/images/2024/07/08/464x312/NPkb6lfmqlaPcwdojd9FPkVUGBtQAM9gsYJ039df.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1714986,"lng":55.